<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds off lows, seen tracking Bunds.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds off lows, seen tracking Bunds.</headline>
<text>
<p>1715 GMT - Portuguese bonds ended off lows and were expected to track Bunds with a yield spread of around 115 bps on Friday.</p>
<p>*March 97 futures down 0.01 points to 108.18</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash 99.75 vs 99.65, yld 6.66 pct vs 6.67 pct.</p>
<p>*Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash -7 bps vs -8 bps</p>
</text>
